Advanced Alerting Strategies
Objectives
Design and deploy a complete observability stack (Prometheus, Alertmanager, Node Exporter) from scratch on a bare Ubuntu instance
Implement multi-condition PromQL alerting rules that fire only when two or more system metrics breach thresholds simultaneously
Build an alert routing topology in Alertmanager that delivers notifications to different receivers based on severity and alert type, and suppresses redundant alerts using inhibition rules
Prerequisites
Comfort with the Linux command line: navigating the filesystem, editing files with a terminal editor, and managing systemd services
Familiarity with YAML syntax and the concept of key-value configuration files
Basic understanding of what CPU, memory, and disk metrics represent in an operating system context
Lab Environment
You will work on a dedicated AWS EC2 Ubuntu instance provided by Al Nafi. The instance has a base Ubuntu installation; you will install all required tools in Task 1.

