Requirement 2
Design a controlled load generation procedure using stress-ng that drives CPU usage above 80 percent and memory usage above 70 percent on the instance at the same time for at least five minutes. While the load runs, poll the Prometheus alerts API every 30 seconds and capture the moment each alert transitions from pending to firing. Record the exact timestamp and alert name for each transition.

