Requirement 2
Design an Alertmanager routing configuration that satisfies all five of the following constraints simultaneously, then trigger a firing alert and confirm the webhook server receives the notification:

Alerts labeled severity: critical must be routed to a receiver named critical-team with a group_wait of 5 seconds and a repeat_interval of 5 minutes.
Alerts labeled severity: warning must be routed to a receiver named warning-team with a repeat_interval of 2 hours.
Alerts labeled alert_type: predictive must be routed to a receiver named capacity-planning with a repeat_interval of 6 hours, regardless of severity.
An inhibition rule must suppress all severity: warning alerts on the same instance whenever a severity: critical alert is already firing on that instance.
A second inhibition rule must suppress all alerts labeled alert_type: predictive on the same instance whenever any alert labeled alert_type: composite is firing on that instance.
All three named receivers must point to the webhook server on port 5001 at distinct URL paths (/critical, /warning, /capacity).

# Step 1 â Write the advanced Alertmanager configuration
sudo tee /etc/alertmanager/alertmanager.yml <<'EOF'
global:
  resolve_timeout: 5m

route:
  group_by: ['alertname', 'instance']
  group_wait: 30s
  group_interval: 10s
  repeat_interval: 12h
  receiver: 'default'
  routes:
    - match:
        alert_type: predictive
      receiver: 'capacity-planning'
      repeat_interval: 6h

    - match:
        severity: critical
      receiver: 'critical-team'
      group_wait: 5s
      repeat_interval: 5m

    - match:
        severity: warning
      receiver: 'warning-team'
      repeat_interval: 2h

receivers:
  - name: 'default'
    webhook_configs:
      - url: 'http://localhost:5001/alerts'
        send_resolved: true

  - name: 'critical-team'
    webhook_configs:
      - url: 'http://localhost:5001/critical'
        send_resolved: true

  - name: 'warning-team'
    webhook_configs:
      - url: 'http://localhost:5001/warning'
        send_resolved: true

  - name: 'capacity-planning'
    webhook_configs:
      - url: 'http://localhost:5001/capacity'
        send_resolved: true

inhibit_rules:
  - source_match:
      severity: 'critical'
    target_match:
      severity: 'warning'
    equal: ['instance']

  - source_match:
      alert_type: 'composite'
    target_match:
      alert_type: 'predictive'
    equal: ['instance']
EOF

